onfigure substitution). Configure options recorded by jemalloc-config: --enable-autogen --with-lg-page=16. No header files and no manual pages are installed. Relationship: no ELF file in the image lists libjemalloc as a needed library (all 517 ELF files checked with readelf); the image sets no LD_PRELOAD or MALLOC_CONF and has no /etc/ld.so.preload; nothing in the image calls jemalloc.sh; hostapd_s1g and hostapd_cli_s1g are statically linked and contain no jemalloc; python3 and the other programs use the musl allocator. The library is present but is not loaded by any program in the image as built. Its library dependencies are libstdc++, libgcc_s and musl (apk packages recorded here). The upstream source is not archived with the product.
